      "content": "look im just trying to understand the science so i can make an informed choice. i read online somewhere that dextromethorphan is a serotonin reuptake inhibitor too. if i'm already on sertraline, isn't the main concern just that it might increase serotonin levels a bit? is that actually a life-threatening thing or is it just minor stuff like jitters or nausea? i really need to know if i should just grab this or if i'm looking at something serious.",
